      "writtenOn": "2024-08-19T13:26:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Given that these have been promoted we can remove the KHR suffixes. Ah but we\u0027ll need to have a graceful mode to allow for the functions not being present if 1.2 even is supported.\n\nhttps://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/1.3-extensions/man/html/VK_KHR_draw_indirect_count.html says\n\n\u003e All functionality in this extension is included in core Vulkan 1.2, with the KHR suffix omitted. However, if Vulkan 1.2 is supported and this extension is not, the commands vkCmdDrawIndirectCount and vkCmdDrawIndexedIndirectCount are optional. The original type, enum and command names are still available as aliases of the core functionality.\n\nComments here and in VulkanExtensions.h/.cpp taken together will allow using multidraw even in Vulkan 1.2 without the extension being exposed.",
      "revId": "089c8f4e2d8034ac3f58926e1d775c4e5dcad7c7",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
