      "writtenOn": "2024-08-19T16:15:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason I did not take into account the promotion to 1.2 was that numerous existing features were promoted to core in 1.2, and it would throw a this validation error https://docs.vulkan.org/spec/latest/chapters/devsandqueues.html#VUID-VkDeviceCreateInfo-pNext-02830. I thought it would be better off having a separate CL to refactor all the feature enabling for 1.2.",
      "parentUuid": "f8059739_f32a27f8",
